{"unit_id":"pairun325__dsh-whale-sense#feature-1","repo":"pairun325/dsh-whale-sense","commit":"2da058ab0e8659f8e6a0083e624744fd9a48f82e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-whale-sense 的功能「自动监测画面变化」：帮工定时截屏并比较灰度缩略图，变化达到阈值且冷却结束后保存整图并发出事件；开启自动模式时由当前会话跟进。","source":"generated","evidence":["helper/sense.py:142-170","lib/index.js:258-309"]}
